  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "箸"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><b style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>陳柏宇</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">In講：『筷子只是工具』</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">阿公講：「食飯知家底」</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">飯桌頂面分大細</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">人客、序大suà--落tsiah是lán ê</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">做人頭家序細</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">碗箸排好　小等--一-下</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Mài成胡蠅戴龍眼殼、小鬼mooh壁lin-long-se̍h</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">輕聲細sueh</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">請序大　請人客</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">請in坐好勢</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">一雙箸　平行線</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">頭尾khioh hōo齊</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tsíng頭公做be-á-lìn-gù（ベアリング）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">中tsáinn kap kí-tsáinn gia̍p hōo在</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">M̄-thang幌--leh幌--leh bē輸做風颱</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">一雙箸　百種名</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">頂港下港島內海外群島半島lóng仝字</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">只是有所在叫「tī」、阮號「tū」、mā是有人huah「はし」</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">有圓mā有扁</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">M̄-koh tuì tīng-khok-khok肉骨到軟sìm-sìm ê豆腐</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">滑滑滑ê皮蛋到幼幼幼ê肉hú</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tsìnn、炒、煎、滷　攑箸lóng ē用--得</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">若beh ngeh菜</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">大叉大耙萬萬bē-sái</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">M̄-thang箸做匙、盤做鍋</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Thuh落盤底</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Ná hôo ná揀ná炒菜</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">更加m̄-thang直直插落碗底拜</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">In講：『用刀叉才有文化』</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">看人用『筷子』就講：『好棒好厲害』</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">無看阮刀仔、tshiám仔用了無khah害</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">阿公講：「攑箸攑好khah實在」</span></p><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhklLmz6Thz3hLC7d2q9OnN6zM2TwRbu_rhQh13axyfa5vuYeJSISVroRij44Hg6jHMd6FkPl0BJulwW97MXSuuof68UBFoJH7ESwFV5Gq9rkW_RmcGK2oEoFv2gvWxMWrbXLkt9lrDn5u_hrOUuEyzeWPL-L1TDP0DyvN6HLpGk23nj6GDISHpuVwPUQ/s1424/336%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhklLmz6Thz3hLC7d2q9OnN6zM2TwRbu_rhQh13axyfa5vuYeJSISVroRij44Hg6jHMd6FkPl0BJulwW97MXSuuof68UBFoJH7ESwFV5Gq9rkW_RmcGK2oEoFv2gvWxMWrbXLkt9lrDn5u_hrOUuEyzeWPL-L1TDP0DyvN6HLpGk23nj6GDISHpuVwPUQ/w450-h640/336%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgFQwWwTj_hy0QqFoY6txZ8vNVT2XWRBPDme8TmeFyz3Fvl5w2i45hFO0qYsVmI4TCq2C9awsuBQoXMv60J7ZSH9tbS3-vcWRLpKze5RO0sVppCvoExu0Ho0bTyXg2d9QmsFsKgOKVm1FRXlm5RmmE2Fxm9V-HDi8uiYm79hQi_w0FlKW2O08j8dnU2rw/s4300/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1336%E6%9C%9F_02_03.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1e